---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Claims" description="Find clear TIRO funeral cover claims guidance and prepare for the next step.">
  <section class="claims-hero section"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Claims support</p><h1>Here when it matters most.</h1><p>When you are ready, TIRO will guide you through the current claims process with care and clarity.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container claims-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before you start</p><h2 class="heading">Gather the right information.</h2><p>Having the policy details and the right contact information nearby can make the conversation easier for your family.</p></div><ol class="claim-steps"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Find the policy details</h3><p>Have the policy number and policyholder’s details ready, if available.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Contact TIRO</h3><p>Ask TIRO for the current claim requirements and the approved way to send documents.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Keep your reference</h3><p>Write down your claim reference and the next steps TIRO confirms with you.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
  <section class="claim-help section"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">Need a guide?</p><h2 class="heading">Understand what to prepare.</h2><p>Read the simple guide before you begin a claim conversation.</p></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/learn/what-to-prepare-for-a-funeral-claim/">Read claims guidance <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  .claims-hero { background: var(--tiro-navy); color: white; }.claims-hero > .container { max-width: 900px; }.claims-hero .eyebrow { color: white; }.claims-hero h1 { margin: 12px 0 16px; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.7rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.055em; }.claims-hero p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 650px; font-size: 1.15rem; }.claims-grid { display: grid; gap: 36px; align-items: start; }.claims-grid > div > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 570px; font-size: 1.08rem; }.claim-steps { display: grid; gap: 26px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }.claim-steps li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 54px 1fr; gap: 16px; }.claim-steps span { width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--tiro-red); color: white; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 800; }.claim-steps h3 { margin: 0 0 7px; color: var(--tiro-navy); font-size: 1.18rem; }.claim-steps p { margin: 0; }.claim-help { background: var(--tiro-soft-white); }.claim-help .container { display: grid; gap: 24px; align-items: center; }.claim-help p:not(.eyebrow) { font-size: 1.05rem; } @media (min-width: 850px) { .claims-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }.claim-help .container { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; } }
</style>
